      "message": "In fact this instead can not wake\nFirst,uldren didn\u0027t have config `PLATFORM_EC_POWERSEQ_INTEL`.\nSecond,base on first point,uldren didn\u0027t run `power/intel_x86.c`\n```\nzephyr_library_sources_ifdef(CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_POWERSEQ_INTEL\n                                                \"${PLATFORM_EC}/power/intel_x86.c\")\n```\nIt will cause uldren can\u0027t call `chipset_force_g3()`\n\nThird,`chipset_force_shutdown()` is called by `shim/src/chipset_api.c`\n```\nvoid chipset_force_shutdown(enum chipset_shutdown_reason reason)\n{\n\tap_power_force_shutdown((enum ap_power_shutdown_reason)reason);\n}\n```",
